    "cnn_note": "Severity and class come from the independent physics cross-check (scripts/physics_severity.py) run on reanalysis drivers. The CNN was not re-run: its t2 tensor needs Sentinel-1/2 + Landsat + ERA5-Land bands over Earth Engine for the historical window. These are not model-skill numbers.",
